        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5050LSSK, L-Squared Reeded Lever with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHere is something new for your home remodel project. The Reed Lever with Square Rose merges classic and modern styles into something that is as bold as it is timeless. The L-Squared Straight Knurled Lever with Square Rose is made with the attention to quality and detail you've come to expect from Emtek. It is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from a wide array of stylish finish color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSSK-specifications.gif?v=1704354615\" width=\"600\" height=\"167\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek LS Straight Knurled Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the L-Square Straight Knurled Door Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Straight Knurled L-Squared Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSSK-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262405\"><b>Emtek L-Squared Straight Knurled Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Reed Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "Here is something new for your home remodel project. The Reed Lever with Square Rose merges classic and modern styles into something that is as bold as it is timeless. The L-Squared Straight Knurled Lever with Square Rose is made with the attention to quality and detail you've come to expect from Emtek. It is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from a wide array of stylish finish color options.",
                "keywords": "L-Squared Straight Knurled Levers, Reed Lever with Square Roses, Emtek 5050LSSK, Emtek 5050LSSK dummy levers, Emtek 5110LSSK passage levers, Emtek 5210LSSK privacy levers, L-Square Straight Knurled Door Lever with Square Roses, Straight Knurled L-Squared Leverset with Square Roses, L-Squared Reeded Lever with Square Rosettes, transitional door hardware,"
            },
